# Decision Ledger

Append-only record for durable implementation decisions.

## Entry Format

Each entry should include:

- date + implementation or work identifier
- affected public surface or component
- what changed
- why
- where reflected
- evidence

## Notes

- Append new entries; do not rewrite history in normal agent flows.
- Use ADRs under `decisions/` when a change needs a fuller record.
